  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:24 AM",
      "text": "You had it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:42 AM",
      "text": "Yeah, I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "Put your PR hat on...they need to get together and say what happened, in their words, that they regret it, they’re sorry, etc"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:43 AM",
      "text": "Knew you had it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:44 AM",
      "text": "Try to put a bow on it, it’s better for them going forward"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:44 AM",
      "text": "That is in a perfect world. They are not going to do that. It’s deep."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:44 AM",
      "text": "Yeah I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:44 AM",
      "text": "I do agree with you."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "I can get Rod but Mario wont"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:45 AM",
      "text": "That is a lot of $ to throw away for working half a year."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Lynn obviously talked with Mario"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:46 AM",
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "11:54 AM",
      "text": "I liked your Best Moments column. You should make that a monthly during the season"
    }
  ]
}